essImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.Result\">Simp.Result</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Preprocesses `e` using `grind` normalization theorems and simprocs,\nand then applies several other preprocessing steps.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.preprocessImpl","kind":"def","line":107,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.preprocessImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.lean#L107-L138"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.dsimpCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">dsimpCore</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Similar to `simpCore`, but uses `dsimp`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.dsimpCore","kind":"def","line":102,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.dsimpCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.lean#L102-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.simpCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpCore</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.Result\">Simp.Result</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Simplifies the given expression using the `grind` simprocs and normalization theorems.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.simpCore","kind":"def","line":98,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.simpCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.lean#L98-L100"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.symNorm\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">symNorm</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">methods</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Methods\">Sym.Simp.Methods</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">dmethods</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Methods\">Sym.DSimp.Methods</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.State\">Sym.Simp.State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ds</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.State\">Sym.DSimp.State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Sym.SymM</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Simp/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Simp.Result\">Simp.Result</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Simp/SimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.State\">Sym.Simp.State</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.State\">Sym.DSimp.State</a>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `Sym.simp`-based normalization step: `Sym.simp` with `methods`, then `Sym.dsimp` of the result\nwith `dmethods`. The two passes are independent, and their states are threaded through.\n\n`Sym.simp` does not visit the fixed arguments of an application, e.g. the implicit objects of a\nmorphism composition, while the legacy normalizer `dsimp`s them (`Simp.Config.dsimp`). A beta-redex\nor a projection of a structure instance left in such an argument makes the term miss the E-matching\npatterns of its theorems, so the `dsimp` pass reduces them. Its result is definitionally equal to\nthe `simp` result, so the proof is the one of the `simp` pass.\n\n`Sym` requires kernel projections to be folded into projection applications. The legacy normalizer\naccepts them, so `preprocessImpl` folds them only afterwards; they are folded here first.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.symNorm","kind":"def","line":24,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.symNorm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.lean#L24-L48"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isLegacyNormalizer\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">isLegacyNormalizer</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if the legacy `simp`-based normalizer is selected (`backward.grind.normalizer`).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isLegacyNormalizer","kind":"def","line":20,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.isLegacyNormalizer","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Simp.lean#L20-L22"}}],"imports":["Init.Grind.Lemmas","Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Main","Lean.Meta.Sym.Simp.Main","Lean.Meta.Sym.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.MarkNestedSubsingletons","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.MatchDiscrOnly","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Types","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Simp.Main"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Simp"}